1784333188.750 RX Newhaven, Village Entrance
1784333188.751 RX     Welcome to Newhaven! You are standing at the crude wooden gates of the
1784333188.751 RX village entrance, in the middle of a dusty path. A low wooden palisade
1784333188.751 RX surrounds the village, to protect against creatures of the night and random
1784333188.751 RX raiders. You can see small buildings to the north and south, and a dusty path
1784333188.751 RX that leads to the west and southeast. 
1784333188.771 RX You notice large sign, newbie manual here.
1784333188.771 RX Obvious exits: north, south, west, southeast
