1784333220.199 RX Newhaven, Narrow Path
1784333220.199 RX     This narrow path is fairly plain, save for the small lanterns hanging from
1784333220.199 RX the trees around. North of you lies a strangely decorated shop, and a beat-up
1784333220.199 RX shack labeled "General Store" lies to your south. The path leads east and west
1784333220.199 RX from here. 
