1784333222.926 RX Newhaven, Narrow Road
1784333222.926 RX     This narrow road is quite plain save for the various lanterns hanging from
1784333222.926 RX the trees around, and a large stone stairwell leading downwards. You hear the
1784333222.926 RX clash of steel below you, and cries of pain and triumph accompanying it. Stone
1784333222.926 RX buildings lie to your north and west. 
1784333222.926 RX Obvious exits: north, east, west, down
