1784333225.715 RX [HP=28]:Newhaven, Adventurer's Guild
1784333225.716 RX     This nicely crafted room is well furnished and decorated with things that
1784333225.716 RX you have never seen before, from strange exotic weapons, to swirling vials of
1784333225.716 RX liquid. A well toned man, stands in front of a practice mat with his arms
1784333225.716 RX crossed. He stands up lightly at your approach, looks you up and down, and
1784333225.716 RX breaks into a lopsided grin. 
1784333225.716 RX Also here: Corwyn.
1784333225.716 RX Obvious exits: south
